Package: rldyour-sysinfo
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NDDev OpenNetwork <danil@nddev.it.com>
Depends: init-system-helpers
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Low-overhead live system metrics daemon
 Publishes CPU, memory, GPU, temperature, disk, and network readings as
 newline-delimited JSON over a per-user Unix socket. A systemd user socket
 unit is enabled for all sessions, so the daemon runs only while a client —
 the GNOME Shell extension, or the Python client library — is attached.
